55	## Design tokens
56	
57	Every color and font is a CSS custom property. Components never carry a literal
58	hex, so one override point recolors the whole page correctly.
59	
60	```css
61	:root {
62	  --ink: #1A1D21;          /* primary text, graphite */
63	  --paper: #F2F3F5;        /* page background, cool grey */
64	  --paper-raised: #FFFFFF; /* card surfaces sitting on --paper */
65	  --line: #D6D9DD;         /* hairline borders and rules */
66	  --accent: #1F5C8B;       /* primary accent, drawing blue */
67	  --accent-soft: #E4EDF4;  /* accent tint for pills and highlights */
68	
69	  /* Semantic, never repurposed as branding */
70	  --good: #2E7248;
71	  --good-soft: #E3EFE7;
72	  --warn: #A8641A;
73	  --warn-soft: #F7EBDA;
74	  --critical: #A93226;
75	  --critical-soft: #F9E9E7;
76	
77	  --font-display: 'IBM Plex Sans Condensed', 'Arial Narrow', sans-serif;
78	  --font-body: 'IBM Plex Sans', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
79	  --font-mono: 'IBM Plex Mono', 'SF Mono', Consolas, monospace;
